Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:12.06,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:18.53,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:24.74,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:31.05,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:47.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.10,0:00:54.33,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:01:01.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.65,0:01:06.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.99,0:01:13.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.19,0:01:24.57,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:40.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.07,0:01:44.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.11,0:01:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:50.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想得到这女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:02:01.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第70话 再次苏醒的鬼蜘蛛记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.61,0:02:05.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想得到你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:08.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.91,0:02:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.23,0:02:22.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.77,0:02:33.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 不要阻碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:41.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么找上戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:42.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.51,0:02:45.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:52.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.49,0:02:55.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:03:00.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:05.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:11.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:23.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙为什么想要抓戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.55,0:03:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然他背上有蜘蛛的伤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:30.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双应该是奈落的分身没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:34.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正面承受风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:36.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该不可能还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:38.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是总觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:43.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 未免太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:57.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.65,0:03:59.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:01.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情已经解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:05.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:13.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好 托你的福
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍后再来换药吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.64,0:04:20.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:26.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:31.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里的话就不用担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:33.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双师父
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.09,0:04:38.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的师父被杀害 脸被夺走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:41.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真残忍 到底是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:43.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙没有脸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:48.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且背上有蜘蛛的图案
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.34,0:04:49.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:53.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可怕 太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:55.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带他进去休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:57.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:01.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背上有蜘蛛的图案
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:03.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落分身的杰作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:09.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙…又想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:17.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:20.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会在意我也是身不由己
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.70,0:05:21.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.07,0:05:27.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心依然强烈的残存在你的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:44.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 奈落那浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底什么时候才要放了我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:48.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:51.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.67,0:05:52.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:55.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想出去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.61,0:05:59.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了 以后不会再逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.74,0:06:02.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去追一个叫无双的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:03.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.81,0:06:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也算是你的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:11.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.92,0:06:14.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的新分身？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:19.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后告诉犬夜叉他们无双的行踪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:20.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:24.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 那家伙会去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那里错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 对我做这么过分的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.65,0:06:45.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是谁 犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.79,0:06:48.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.53,0:06:54.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识…那个家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.03,0:07:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…是谁…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:01.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.91,0:07:04.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样真的好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:07.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 你暂时回那边去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.81,0:07:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是难得
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你每次都说不要随便回去的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.48,0:07:14.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了这次没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.05,0:07:15.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:17.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我很在意考试结果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:20.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以很感谢你让我回去啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:25.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘暂时躲着比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:28.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到弄清楚奈落的企图为止
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.70,0:07:29.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:32.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得很不安呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.27,0:07:33.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.01,0:07:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:46.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你穿的铠甲不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:47.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这景色怎么搞的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像似曾相识
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.61,0:08:14.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的回去比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:16.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫无双的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:18.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道真实身分
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:21.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他想要抓你对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:27.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是无双已经被犬夜叉的风之伤打倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:31.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对犬夜叉而言还真是用心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:35.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然到目前为止 已经和奈落的分身交战过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还是他第一次这么小心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.74,0:08:40.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:43.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也有不祥的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:45.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去那个地方看看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:46.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:49.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先回家去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到那个洞窟去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洞窟的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.85,0:08:55.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:02.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:09.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洞穴？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:22.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…知道这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:26.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:27.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:30.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的目的到底是哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:31.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落城…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:33.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有目标了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:35.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:37.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是胡乱走咯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.49,0:09:39.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说蠢话了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:42.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在朝无双来的 相反方向前进啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:45.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去被袭击的村子如何
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:49.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强盗们被杀的地方也去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:54.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:59.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:02.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来打架的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:05.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是想告诉你们无双在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:06.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:08.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙还活着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:11.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我不知为何一直很在意他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:14.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你要来告诉我们这些
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道桔梗和鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:18.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起生活的洞窟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双正往那里去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:22.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:24.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双去了那个洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:26.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确实的传达到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:30.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等！是奈落唆使你的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:32.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落是否知道犬夜叉的秘…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.99,0:10:37.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别多嘴了 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:38.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秘密？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:42.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…什么都没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人到底在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:53.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐似乎曾带着四魂碎片逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她应该不是绝对服从奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:11:01.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐没有告诉奈落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:03.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉朔日的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:05.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算这样她也不是同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:09.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不能完全相信神乐说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:15.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是稀奇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.39,0:11:16.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是平常的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.86,0:11:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定马上就砍过去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:20.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:25.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你在急躁什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:27.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:32.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之就是会不由自主的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:34.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想到无双那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.11,0:11:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙什么跟什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:41.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真搞不懂…奈落那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.15,0:11:45.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去告诉犬夜叉他们无双的行踪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:48.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后监视那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:52.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛是要 监视那家伙的一举一动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:55.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道无双和我不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:57.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不受奈落的支配吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.81,0:12:05.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你还没回去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:11.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得 自己也想去看看那个洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:14.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在前面了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:17.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:21.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里…曾经有谁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:25.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:28.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:33.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前鬼蜘蛛待过那里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:39.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是…一切灾厄的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.81,0:12:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:44.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想得到那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.99,0:12:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:55.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…的确在这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:12:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心脚边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧的 枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:03.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我想得到那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:11.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算向魔物出卖魂魄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:15.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:23.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.59,0:13:25.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:26.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:29.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.73,0:13:31.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要得到桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:38.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能！怎么会是那家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:39.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:42.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还记得那家伙散发的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:43.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是真让人难以致信
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:46.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙为什么现在还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:50.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碍事 老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.61,0:13:52.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有事要找那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.85,0:13:55.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个拥有桔梗模样的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.42,0:13:56.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:58.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然是野盗鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.39,0:14:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:02.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.89,0:14:04.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要找的人是我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:08.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不会那么轻易被你抓到的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:10.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥 你快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.87,0:14:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住！ 谁理你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:13.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有桔梗身影的你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:18.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:22.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:24.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:32.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:33.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么还不回去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来搅局啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:40.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:41.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？为什么在这？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.83,0:14:45.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还有无双也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前当强盗时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:53.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这洞窟与桔梗度过的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在胡扯什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:58.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 这家伙是鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:01.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛就是向妖怪献上身体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.12,0:15:04.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,构成奈落的大坏蛋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.06,0:15:06.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真敢说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.73,0:15:11.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受到严重烧伤的鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.59,0:15:13.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是没有脸的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:16.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以这家伙才会抢别人的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:20.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是鬼蜘蛛的心 从奈落体内跑出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:23.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的事我都想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:26.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗在那个时候死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:27.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.98,0:15:29.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:31.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你伤害了桔梗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:33.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:34.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我是了为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而让妖怪吞噬身体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.15,0:15:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想得到四魂之玉与自由的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后带着桔梗 从这洞穴离开而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:49.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在我得到全新的身体后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却完全事与愿违
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从洞穴出来后 所做的第一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:16:00.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然是撕裂了 我不惜向妖怪出卖魂魄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:02.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也想要得到的女人的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:07.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落诞生的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:09.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还拥有鬼蜘蛛的意识吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:13.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落是大量妖怪的集合体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.69,0:16:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些妖怪们最希望的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.89,0:16:18.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是身为巫女的姐姐的死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.63,0:16:21.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄到最后桔梗竟然
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.30,0:16:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追随那半妖浑蛋之后而死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:30.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:34.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉也随着 桔梗的亡骸一起燃烧殆尽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:36.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:38.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:41.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.95,0:16:45.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将我监禁在深沉的黑暗中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:48.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:52.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后我不知沉睡了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:54.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到回过神来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:57.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经被丢到外面的世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:17:00.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙完全都不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:02.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连奈落也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.61,0:17:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有从奈落那边接到命令吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我谁的命令都不听
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.01,0:17:11.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是看不顺眼的家伙就杀光
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再烧光而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:14.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看最先
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:16.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 就从你开始好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:19.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.19,0:17:21.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗明明已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.26,0:17:23.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.66,0:17:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然挑这时候觉醒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.76,0:17:27.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先宰掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:29.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一个就是那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.13,0:17:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.17,0:17:32.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别对戈薇出手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来跟你打
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.14,0:17:38.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想跟我打啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:39.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒虫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:41.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘与枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:42.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你们先避一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:47.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道 奈落为了什么放你出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.85,0:17:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说你和奈落都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.72,0:17:53.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是桔梗的仇人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:02.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤口愈合了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:04.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此！无双的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:07.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有与众不同的再生能力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:08.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少臭屁了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.27,0:18:14.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子你那把怪里怪气的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.31,0:18:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就砍不了我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:19.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来这种对手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:22.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的风穴应该能派上用场的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:24.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落在保护鬼蜘蛛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.19,0:18:26.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:30.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放出毒虫 就等于是封住了我的风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是无双明明说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.79,0:18:34.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他根本不听奈落的命令吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不清楚奈落的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:48.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:50.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:54.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不想直接和你见面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:55.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:57.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来找你试试
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.59,0:18:59.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:01.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:05.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个拥有鬼蜘蛛的心的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.30,0:19:06.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是杀不了我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.03,0:19:14.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我还残留着鬼蜘蛛的心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:16.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就无法对桔梗出手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算那是假造的身体也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:20.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明知道这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:26.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是身体就是无法对你出手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:32.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那以土块与骨头所构成的你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.87,0:19:50.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.81,0:19:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不杀了我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:56.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别得意忘形了 桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.85,0:20:00.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不杀你不是因为害怕你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.15,0:20:03.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我自己的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.89,0:20:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且也不是杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:10.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是毁了你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:14.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子 我还不能切断与鬼蜘蛛的因缘
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:34.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.19,0:20:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:43.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.19,0:20:45.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.70,0:20:47.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙的再生能力实在…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.01,0:20:57.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:09.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不信他每次都能再生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:16.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是这样就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:18.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双那浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说他根本不听奈落的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.20,0:21:24.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙不受奈落的控制吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:28.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:31.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.67,0:21:33.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管砍几次都没用
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:35.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.28,0:21:38.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又复活了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:40.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.42,0:21:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的没有打倒这家伙的方法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:47.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又变化了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.99,0:21:52.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也渐渐习惯这个身体了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:22:00.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 上面！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:05.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.32,0:22:21.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:28.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.07,0:22:35.10,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.85,0:22:42.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:48.48,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.79,0:22:55.32,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.03,0:23:02.27,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:08.88,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.55,0:23:15.92,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.19,0:23:22.59,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:29.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.87,0:23:35.57,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.11,0:23:51.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.32,0:23:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落将这麻烦的部分舍弃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.39,0:23:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而产生了无双
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.85,0:23:56.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是好奇怪 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.22,0:23:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落想要保护无双
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.29,0:24:00.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然是不要的东西 应该放着不管才对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.63,0:24:02.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落想要将无双吸入体内
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.83,0:24:04.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双的爪子贯穿了奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.60,0:24:05.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.63,0:24:07.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落与无双是敌人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.63,0:24:09.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.10,0:24:11.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一场混乱的死斗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.10,0:24:15.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切的关键 就在于他们背上的蜘蛛
